<Base title="About | Colorteam" description="Colorteam, a design-led marketing agency that helps personal and business brands find their position in the market, reach the right audience, and grow revenue through sharp go-to-market execution." image="/img/og-default.jpg" page="page-studio" navCurrent="/about/">
<div class="ct-page" id="page-studio"><section class="section hero podcast-hero" id="studio-top"><div aria-hidden="true" class="ct-hero-bg"><div class="ct-glow g"></div><div class="ct-glow p"></div><div class="ct-glow w"></div><div class="ct-grid"></div><div class="ct-noise"></div></div><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer"><div class="hero-wrapper"><div class="inner-top-wrap"><a class="sub-title-wrap ct-pill-link" href="#studio-story"><div class="new-text">About</div><div class="inner-sub-title">Since 2017</div><img alt="" class="inner-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-right-lime.svg"/></a><h2 class="inner-title">Who We Are</h2><p class="inner-details">Colorteam, a design-led marketing agency that helps personal and business brands find their position in the market, reach the right audience, and grow revenue through sharp go-to-market execution.</p><div class="inner-button-wrap"><a class="primary-button w-inline-block is-green" href="https://calendar.app.google/MSoTdRKrZPzgjE7QA" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><div class="primary-btn-wrap"><div class="primary-btn-text-wrap _01"><div>Book a Call</div><img alt="" class="primary-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-up-right-dark.svg"/></div><div class="primary-btn-text-wrap _02"><div>Book a Call</div><img alt="" class="primary-icon" src="/img/icons/arrow-up-right-dark.svg"/></div><div class="primary-btn-bg"></div></div></a><a class="watch-button w-inline-block" href="/work/"><div class="watch-btn-wrap"><img alt="" class="watch-icon" src="/img/icons/play.svg"/><div class="watch-btn-text">See Our Work</div></div><div class="watch-btn-bg"></div></a></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section ct-story" id="studio-story"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer">
<div class="ct-story-grid">
<div><span class="ct-chip">Who we are</span><h2 class="ct-story-h">A group of creative minds with one shared vision</h2></div>
<div class="ct-story-text">
<p>Colorteam bridges the gap between design and marketing. Our team is spread across the globe, which means every brief gets diverse perspectives, and we are always learning new ways to execute the work our clients bring us.</p>
<p>We are a boutique agency that doesn't think small. We have worked with companies at the highest levels of business, from founders launching their first product to global brands and Fortune 500 teams.</p>
<h3>Why we exist</h3>
<p>Colorteam was born in 2017 with a simple tagline: "we love startups". Our founder was building a marketing agency of his own, reached out to design agencies for support, and was met with invoices no early-stage business could afford. So he set out to build the agency he had been looking for: one that helps ambitious brands without massive budgets bring their vision to life, creatively and properly.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>
<section class="section ct-philo"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer">
<div class="ct-philo-grid">
<div><span class="ct-chip">Our philosophy</span><h2 class="ct-philo-h">Design Beyond <span>Boundaries</span></h2><p>Design is a key part of marketing, and marketing has many moving parts that benefit from the polish design brings. When we say design, we don't only mean pixels. We mean a way of thinking that obsesses over crafting experiences that solve real problems.</p></div>
</div>
</div></section>
<section class="section ct-ethos"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer">
<div class="ct-proj-head"><h2 class="ct-proj-h">Mission, Vision and Values</h2><p>What we are here to do, where we are going, and how we behave on the way.</p></div>
<div class="ct-ethos-top">
<div class="ct-ethos-card is-pink"><span>Mission</span><p>Colorteam exists to craft integrated creative solutions that are not just visually compelling but strategically powerful.</p></div>
<div class="ct-ethos-card is-dark"><span>Vision</span><p>To be the global benchmark for innovative creative solutions that seamlessly merge design and marketing, transforming how businesses tell their stories and connect with their audiences.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="ct-values">
<div><b>01</b><h4>Uncompromising Quality</h4><p>Creative work that exceeds global standards and leaves a lasting impression.</p></div>
<div><b>02</b><h4>Genuine Partnerships</h4><p>Long-term, trust-driven relationships that go beyond the project to help clients grow.</p></div>
<div><b>03</b><h4>Empowerment and Growth</h4><p>We invest in our team, because empowered creatives produce exceptional results.</p></div>
</div>
</div></section>
<section class="section ct-message"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer">
<p class="ct-message-lead">In a world of templates and predictable systems, we deliver design-and-marketing experiences that surprise, inspire and make people say,</p>
<p class="ct-message-quote">“I’ve never seen anything like this before.”</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section ct-founder"><div class="container w-layout-blockcontainer">
<div class="ct-founder-grid">
<img alt="Olasubomi Archibong, founder and CEO of Colorteam" class="ct-founder-img" loading="lazy" src="/img/founder-subomi.webp"/>
<div class="ct-founder-text">
<span class="ct-chip">A note from the founder</span>
<p class="ct-founder-lead">We take pride in working closely with our clients, actively seeking feedback to guide every project towards their satisfaction. That is a win for the client, and a win for us.</p>
<p>Behind every project is a team I am fortunate to work with, from our creative director to our marketing specialists and the consultants around the world who are always ready to pick up the call. And we are deeply grateful to the clients who think of us when they want to bring a visionary project to life. We don't take your trust for granted.</p>
<div class="ct-founder-sign"><img alt="Olasubomi Archibong signature" class="ct-founder-sig" loading="lazy" src="/img/signature-subomi.png"/><span>Olasubomi Archibong, Founder &amp; CEO</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>
